  "markdown": "# When a hub is paged\n\nA hub is paged when two things are true:\n\n- it has more children than its sidebar child cap, so the sidebar shows one\n  entry for them;\n- it has more children than its page size.\n\nAny other hub lists all its children on its own page, exactly as before.",
